Package: calibration
Title: Ensemble Parameter Calibration for Process-Based Ecosystem Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Meng", "Lai", email = "menglai@bu.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Akash", "BV", email = "akash@davidlebauer.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Method-agnostic ensemble calibration of process-based ecosystem
    model parameters against field observations. A generic driver dispatches to a
    calibration method (Ensemble Kalman Inversion first); observation targets and
    priors are built from curated data and PEcAn trait priors, and a forward-model
    adapter runs the ensemble through a PEcAn-configured model. Reuses PEcAn for
    the model run, unit conversion, and trait priors, and is not tied to any one
    model, site, or variable.
